aning services?","tab_content":"<p>Our rates vary depending on the size and condition of the home, as well as the specific services requested. We offer free estimates and are happy to provide a customized quote based on your needs.</p>","_id":"83ad437"},{"tab_title":"What is included in your maid service?","tab_content":"<p>Our maid service includes general cleaning of all rooms, dusting, vacuuming, and mopping. We also offer additional services such as laundry and window cleaning.</p>","_id":"e52493a"},{"tab_title":"How often should I schedule home cleaning services?","tab_content":"<p>This depends on your individual needs and preferences. Some people prefer to have their home cleaned on a weekly or bi-weekly basis, while others prefer monthly or one-time cleanings.</p>","_id":"d8db4d9"},{"tab_title":"What is a deep cleaning service?","tab_content":"<p>A deep cleaning service is a thorough cleaning of your home that goes beyond regular cleaning. It includes cleaning and sanitizing all surfaces, hand detailing baseboards &amp; blinds, cleaning of the interior of windows and other detailed items not typically cleaned during regular maintenance.</p>","_id":"a6f3a0b"},{"tab_title":"What is included in your move-out cleaning service?","tab_content":"<p>Our move-out cleaning service includes a thorough cleaning of all rooms, including bathrooms, kitchens, and bedrooms inside and out. Our goal is to make that house as clean as the day it was first built.</p>","_id":"d6bdbbb"},{"tab_title":"What is included in your home organization services?","tab_content":"<p>Our home organization services include decluttering, reorganizing, and arranging of your living &amp; storage spaces. We work closely with our clients to create functional and visually pleasing living spaces.</p>","_id":"b2b0543"},{"tab_title":"How do I book your services?","tab_content":"You can book our services by contacting us by phone or email, or by booking a customized service based on your needs here: <a hre